{"steam_appid":4563870,"steam_name":"Miseria","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4563870/1323867128/ff801d3c808630cfe1c5667837eb2bce91db32bc/1781538219/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1781538396","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257359600/7f6c248481316d7c8aa99aa931fcb63f8e7b6a28/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1781538396","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/94207c8a44531665fba50535a8c7d6dba809e03d/ss_94207c8a44531665fba50535a8c7d6dba809e03d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786121909","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/5a28746f44db935eb9e7decff90282f98e68715d/ss_5a28746f44db935eb9e7decff90282f98e68715d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786121909","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/abfeb9e511bbc40a4bfacddeb136eb331b256be2/ss_abfeb9e511bbc40a4bfacddeb136eb331b256be2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786121909","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/746bdb1a2e9af9260fcfa32d68463d7bb73ee84f/ss_746bdb1a2e9af9260fcfa32d68463d7bb73ee84f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786121909","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/5bf618a17d09fd7b6ff492a8c5006568e8ebbe9b/ss_5bf618a17d09fd7b6ff492a8c5006568e8ebbe9b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1786121909"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/65a72a9e95df199e969477f4c936bcb6.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1560 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/19a9eee6cba819e99bb1da31e4a4653c.poster.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/19a9eee6cba819e99bb1da31e4a4653c.webm?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/19a9eee6cba819e99bb1da31e4a4653c.mp4?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture deeper into a dark, ever descending abyss in search of your deepest desires. Your party fights automatically as you progress, striking down enemies with relentless attackscharging mana and unleashing powerful abilities. The deeper you go, the greater the danger… and the reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/ba235f798f8e5ef2729ccc6b97a7dc1a.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1560 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/27604f70d4d50178fd406bb5534ee78a.poster.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/27604f70d4d50178fd406bb5534ee78a.webm?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/27604f70d4d50178fd406bb5534ee78a.mp4?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your characters gain experience through combat, allowing you to level up their stats and increase their power. Defeat monsters to earn gold, then visit the blacksmith to upgrade and forge stronger equipment. Every decision shapes how far your team can push into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/08a327058d0f19acedef245c1f340bc1.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1560 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/cfa7099a9d2575407d6f559fa17b9c84.poster.avif?t=1786121909\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/cfa7099a9d2575407d6f559fa17b9c84.webm?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4563870/extras/cfa7099a9d2575407d6f559fa17b9c84.mp4?t=1786121909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embrace the cycle of power through the Reborn system. Reset your progress to gain powerful permanent upgrades and push even further on your next descent. Master the prestige mechanics and break past your previous limits.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 2600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580 <br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 900 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation"],"developers":["Somnambulist Games"],"publishers":["Somnambulist Games"],"release_date":"7 Aug, 2026"}